  "hypothesis_statement": "After terminal V7 INCONCLUSIVE_INFRASTRUCTURE_FAILURE (FROZEN_EXIT_PARAMETERS_MISMATCH before panel access; slot consumed; no reopen), a new definition-only preregistration freezes the same economic treatment as intended for V7 (exact V6 composite midband/max-hold control + same-side reentry cooldown of 24 PT1H bars after forced midband) with a single canonical exit_mechanism.frozen_parameters authority identical to V6 base freeze, plus deterministic pre-authorization parity validation that blocks runner authorization on any mismatch without consuming the evaluation run slot or accessing the panel.",
  "scientific_hypothesis": "V7 failed before measuring economics because the immutable preregistration omitted exit_mechanism.frozen_parameters while the runner asserted V6-style frozen-parameter parity. V8 preserves the V7 economic treatment boundary and closes the wiring gap: frozen base exit parameters are byte-stable under exit_mechanism.frozen_parameters; cooldown remains the sole treatment delta versus V6; a read-only pre-authorization validator requires preregistration frozen parameters == resolved effective strategy parameters == runner payload before any authorization.",
  "economic_hypothesis": "Relative to control arm = exact V6 composite midband OR max-holding exit semantics on the sealed DEVELOPMENT_ONLY panel at frozen 1.0x costs, the V8 treatment (V6 semantics + same-side reentry cooldown=24h) yields jointly: net_return_after_costs_treatment > control, net_profit_factor_treatment >= control, cost_drag_treatment < control, short_trade_count_treatment < control, blocked_same_side_reentry_count > 0, without trade-count collapse below floor, without material long-side damage, without worse max_drawdown beyond tolerance, and without instrument concentration breach.",
  "primary_decision_metric": "NET_RETURN_AFTER_COSTS",
  "primary_decision_metric_contract": "PASS requires measurement-validity and treatment-binding gates first (effective configs differ; open_side binding observed; exit_bars_observed>0; forced_midband_exit_count>0; cooldown_activation_count>0; blocked_same_side_reentry_count>0; arms not identical), then joint satisfaction of all pass_requires_all economic and churn/cost checks. NET_RETURN_AFTER_COSTS is the lead metric; net_profit_factor, cost_drag, short trade counts, max_drawdown, concentration, and long-side companions are hard.",
